axon-provenance-allowlist/1
# EXAMPLE of /etc/axon/provenance-allowlist (amendment 44, decision C).
# Install as root, mode 0644, every directory above it root-owned and not
# group/other-writable; scripts/operator_deploy_protected_host.sh writes exactly
# this. An entry is an exact relative path or a directory prefix ending in "/";
# no globs, ".", "..", ".git", leading "/" or whitespace. An entry that names or
# holds a tracked path refuses the whole list.
#
# target/: cargo's in-tree output (a certified build may set CARGO_TARGET_DIR
#          outside the tree instead). dist/: the guest image build's output.
target/
dist/
